{
  "id": "analytics.owner.v2",
  "version": "2.0.0",
  "description": {
    "en": "The owner's numbers over any period (7, 30, 90 or 365 days, or a from/to range of at most 366 days): orders, takings, average check, refusals, by day / hour / weekday x hour / channel / dish, the previous period and the same weekday a week before and over four weeks, each dish's trend, repeat customers as counts only, and where every day came from (hot log or archived cube). v1 fields are kept unchanged. ?trace=yyyy-mm-dd answers the records behind one day; ?verify=1 the newest archived day, refolded from its archive and compared byte for byte.",
    "uk": "Аналітика власника за будь-який період з порівнянням, трендами страв і трасуванням кожного числа до замовлень."
  },
